{"id":"en_the-doctor-mother-in-law","title":"The Doctor Mother-in-Law","titleEn":"The Doctor Mother-in-Law","description":"Helen awakens in a feudal era, finding herself inside a family on the verge of collapse. Armed with modern medical knowledge and little tolerance for convention, she sets out to change her circumstances. She prevents her granddaughter from being sold, locates relatives who have been lost, and lifts the Stones out of poverty. Her efforts extend further: she establishes a clinic, advocates for women's rights, and challenges the rules that obstruct her. Together the Stones endure betrayal and resistance, rising from outcasts to legends, from mere survival to celebration. Yet in a society wary of change, the durability of their revolution remains uncertain.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-doctor-mother-in-law/en_US/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-doctor-mother-in-law/en_US/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Short Drama","Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dimjy/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-doctor-mother-in-law_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dimjy/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-doctor-mother-in-law_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dimjy/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-doctor-mother-in-law_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dimjy/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-doctor-mother-in-law_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sour